  "prefLabel": "Ph 2401.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 2401.02 Scope. The rules shall regulate pharmacists licensed by the New Hampshire board of pharmacy in the prescribing and dispensing of hormonal contraceptives without a prior prescription.\n\nSource. #13343, eff 2-17-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
